# Booking UI (task.md)

## Flows

Date → list bookings for date → create / edit / delete with start, end, optional `title`. Reflect **09:00–18:00** in controls and validation messages.

## States reviewers expect (task.md)

| State      | Requirement                              |
| ---------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Loading    | While fetching bookings                  |
| Empty      | No bookings on selected date             |
| Error      | Load or mutation failure; user-visible   |
| Submitting | Form send in progress (`отправка формы`) |

## Rule 8 — 409 and other server errors

- **409 when UI showed free slot:** expected; not a bug
- **Clear message** to the user
- **Update bookings list** after conflict
- **Preserve** typed form values (do not wipe on error)
- Other **server errors:** show feedback; no silent failures

## Structure

- Hooks (`useBookings`, `useBookingForm`, …) for data/mutations; thin components in `components/bookings/`

## Accessibility & responsive (task.md)

- Labels / names on inputs and icon buttons; dialog focus; `aria-live` or `role="alert"` for errors
- Works on narrow screens (stack, scroll timeline/grid)
